<title>POLAND: Celuloza Q2 net falls to PLN 14.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Celuloza Q2 net falls to PLN 14.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celuloza preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			16.32 vs     29.70</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  13.51 vs     38.07</p>
<p>    net profit				14.90 vs     22.66</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Celuloza Swiecie SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				175.87 vs    177.74</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 138.28 vs    124.15</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.04  vs	0.06</p>
<p>    income tax		   refund   1.45  vs	8.83</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.06  vs	6.57</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    1.61  vs     66.16</p>
<p>    financial costs			 4.46  vs     57.85</p>
<p>    investment			     81.13  vs     43.24</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     32.75  vs     79.56</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 31.08  vs     90.32</p>
<p>    net profit			     20.40  vs     48.34</p>
<p>    net sales			     336.63  vs    365.39</p>
<p>    costs of sales			260.05  vs    244.11</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.11  vs	0.03</p>
<p>    income tax				9.65  vs     30.91</p>
<p>    other taxes			     1.03  vs     11.11</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    3.34  vs    107.14</p>
<p>    financial costs			 5.12  vs     96.38</p>
<p>    investment			    106.66  vs     70.45</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
